category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libpugixml-devel
sdesc: "C++ library for loading multimodal, multi-rate signals stored in XDF files (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "LibXDF is a cross-platform C++ library for loading multimodal
signals stored in XDF (Extensible Data Format) files. It is used in the
biosignal viewing application SigViewer and the LSL application XDFStreamer and
can also be integrated into other C++ applications."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/xdf-modules/libxdf
license: BSD-2-Clause AND LGPL-3.0-or-later
